# Line endings are LF everywhere, on every platform.
#
# Not a style preference. Several tools in this repo read their own source as
# text and match on it: the Edge Function checker strips URL imports, the
# mirror test slices MIRROR-BEGIN/MIRROR-END regions out of a Deno file, and
# the deploy check parses .env by line. Every one of those was anchored on a
# bare \n, and on a Windows checkout with CRLF they matched nothing and failed
# in ways that blamed the code.
#
# The tools have since been made ending-agnostic, which is the real fix. This
# is the second layer: the files simply do not arrive with CRLF.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Never touch these.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
